{"id":"steam-8780","steam":8780,"igdb":null,"type":"dlc","title":"RACE On","summary":"The RACE On expansion includes all the cars and circuits from the epic WTCC 2008 season. It also adds a massive selection of US Muscle cars and circuits to the mix","about":"RACE On brings you the epic WTCC 2008 season down to the smallest detail and now YOU get the chance to show the world who the real champion is. \r\nThe RACE On Expansion Pack includes the Iconic Detroit Muscle cars suited for those who like to lay down lots of rubber power sliding out of corners on the rev limiter. Enough torque to drag the moon off orbit, full opposite lock and a big grin on your face. Or you can try your hand at the Formula Masters, a top of the line open wheel series, offering you even more speed and action than ever before. Extreme cornering speeds and simulated g-forces make this a true driver’s car.\r\nBut RACE On is not just new cars, it also features brand new American tracks in SimBin quality and it comes with a hefty update of existing tracks to 2008 standard. With RACE ON comes 5 brand new tracks all recreated down to minute detail.\r\n\nKey Features\n\r\n\n• 10 unique car models in 7 different classes\r\n• 5 new tracks \r\n• Various real life championships including their accurate regulations\r\n• Multiplayer, up to 25 AI or real players online\r\n• Ghost racing against your own lap time or against those of your friends","cover":null,"coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/8780/header.jpg?t=1457551366","banner":null,"header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/8780/header.jpg?t=1457551366","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/8780/ss_16b39f99d3f9eb339f08f62076f5eb81dc721570.600x338.jpg?t=1457551366","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/8780/ss_16b39f99d3f9eb339f08f62076f5eb81dc721570.jpg?t=145755136